# MonARCH — AUR packages
#
# Installed by install/20-packages.sh via paru, after base.packages.
# Same format as base.packages: one per line, '#' starts a comment.
#
# AUR builds can fail for reasons outside our control. 20-packages.sh installs
# these one at a time and warns on failure rather than aborting the install.

walker-bin                    # launcher. Not in the official repos, hence AUR
github-desktop-bin
nwg-displays                  # GUI monitor arrangement, writes monitors.conf
claude-desktop                # needs CLAUDE_USE_WAYLAND=1 and /dev/kvm — see T8

# NOT listed here on purpose:
#   hyprbars  — a Hyprland plugin, installed through `hyprpm add`, not the AUR.
#               Set up in T6 (Windows mode), which owns its failure handling.
#   google-chrome, spotify, typora — never bundled. Shipped as one-click
#               installers (monarch-install-*), per golden rule 7.
